WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Start on the EZEapply GitHub page. Scroll to the README and click Download EZEapply for Chrome.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Open Downloads. Extract EZEapply.zip. Double-click the ZIP. Keep the extracted EZEapply folder.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:13.000
Type chrome://extensions, then press Return. Use Chrome’s address bar to open its extension manager.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Turn Developer mode on. The switch is at the top right. Load unpacked appears at the top left.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Click Load unpacked. Choose the button at the top left to open the folder picker.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Select the folder containing manifest.json. Choose the extracted EZEapply folder, then click Select.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:30.000
EZEapply is ready for your next application. Open EZEapply on a job form and click Fill this page.
